flowchart LR
  S([start]) --> A[reserve funds<br/>compensate: release funds]
  A --> B[create account in core<br/>compensate: close account]
  B --> C[notify partner<br/>compensate: send cancellation]
  C --> E([end])
  C -. fails after retries .-> X{{compensation<br/>runs completed steps<br/>in reverse order}}
  X --> C2[send cancellation] --> B2[close account] --> A2[release funds] --> F([ended: compensated])
  X -. a compensate handler fails .-> I[[incident<br/>retry or resolve by hand]]
